The original game
-----------------
This is an unofficial reconstruction of Prince of Persia 2: The Shadow and the Flame (DOS), made for research and
educational purposes by studying the original program. It is not affiliated with, authorised or endorsed by the
game's rights holders. The game, its code, data, graphics, sound, story, names and trademarks belong to them; the
contributors to this repository claim no ownership of the game or of the logic reconstructed from it, and the license
above grants no rights to any of it. No game data is included: using this software requires your own copy of the
original game.

